{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of substrings in `input_string` where the sum of the substring's digits equals its length.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_sum_of_digits(s: str) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper function to calculate the sum of numeric values of characters in a string.\"\"\"\n        total_sum = 0\n        for char in s:\n            total_sum += int(char)\n        return total_sum\n\n    valid_substring_count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            substring = input_string[i : j + 1]\n            current_length = len(substring)\n            sum_digits = _calculate_sum_of_digits(substring)\n\n            if sum_digits == current_length:\n                valid_substring_count += 1\n    return valid_substring_count"}
