{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "class NewmanConwaySequence:\n    \"\"\"Helper class to calculate Newman-Conway sequence terms with memoization.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    def calculateNthTerm(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Computes the nth Newman-Conway sequence number using memoization.\"\"\"\n        if n in self._memo:\n            return self._memo[n]\n\n        # P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n        p_n_minus_1 = self.calculateNthTerm(n - 1)\n        term1 = self.calculateNthTerm(p_n_minus_1)\n        term2 = self.calculateNthTerm(n - p_n_minus_1)\n\n        result = term1 + term2\n        self._memo[n] = result\n        return result\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    This function uses a helper class with memoization for efficient computation.\n    \"\"\"\n    calculator = NewmanConwaySequence()\n    return calculator.calculateNthTerm(n)"}
