{"task_id": "Mbpp/140", "solution": "from typing import Iterable, Union\ndef extract_singly(nested_collections: list[Iterable[Union[int, float]]]) -> set[Union[int, float]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a list of nested iterable numeric collections into a single set of unique numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_set = set()\n    for inner_collection in nested_collections:\n        for element in inner_collection:\n            result_set.add(element)\n    return result_set"}
