{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "from typing import List, Any\ndef list_split(input_list: List[Any], n: int) -> List[List[Any]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a list into 'n' sublists based on element index modulo 'n'.\n    Elements are distributed such that their relative order within each sublist is preserved.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n\n    output_list_of_lists: List[List[Any]] = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    for i, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        target_sublist_index = i % n\n        output_list_of_lists[target_sublist_index].append(element)\n\n    return output_list_of_lists"}
