{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n even natural numbers.\n    Iterates from 1 to n, finding each even number, cubing it, and adding to a running total.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_number = 2 * i\n        cube = even_number ** 3\n        total_sum += cube\n    return total_sum"}
