{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even factors for a given positive integer.\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_factor(n: int, f: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if f is a factor of n.\"\"\"\n        return n % f == 0\n\n    def _is_even(n: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if n is an even number.\"\"\"\n        return n % 2 == 0\n\n    sum_of_even_factors = 0\n    for potential_factor in range(1, number + 1):\n        if _is_factor(number, potential_factor):\n            if _is_even(potential_factor):\n                sum_of_even_factors += potential_factor\n\n    return sum_of_even_factors"}
