{"task_id": "Mbpp/741", "solution": "def all_Characters_Same(input_string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if all characters in the input string are identical.\n    Returns True if all characters are the same, or if the string is empty or has one character.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string or len(input_string) == 1:\n        return True\n    first_char = input_string[0]\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char != first_char:\n            return False\n    return True"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/740", "solution": "def tuple_to_dict(input_tuple: tuple) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a tuple into a dictionary using adjacent elements as key-value pairs.\n    If the tuple has an odd number of elements, the last element is ignored.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_dict = {}\n    for i in range(0, len(input_tuple) - 1, 2):\n        key = input_tuple[i]\n        value = input_tuple[i+1]\n        result_dict[key] = value\n    return result_dict"}
