{"task_id": "Mbpp/758", "solution": "from collections import Counter\ndef unique_sublists(input_list: list[list]) -> dict[tuple, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of unique sublists within a list of lists, returning a dictionary\n    mapping tuple representations of sublists to their counts.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts = Counter()\n    for sublist in input_list:\n        counts[tuple(sublist)] += 1\n    return dict(counts)"}
