{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if each element of tuple2 is smaller than its corresponding element in tuple1.\n\n    Returns True if all elements in tuple2 are smaller than their corresponding elements in tuple1, False otherwise (including length mismatch).\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        if not (tuple2[i] < tuple1[i]):\n            return False\n    return True"}
