{"task_id": "Mbpp/66", "solution": "def pos_count(list_of_numbers: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of positive numbers in a list.\n    Iterates through the list, incrementing a counter for each number greater than zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for number in list_of_numbers:\n        if number > 0:\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
